@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Deployed on ceAI+ (public path; no trailing slash):
# @base = https://apps.polylink.org/<username>/<app-name>

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### W1 Search journals
GET {{base}}/journals?q=neural

### W1 Journal details
GET {{base}}/journals/J03

### W2 Follow J03
POST {{base}}/bookshelf
Content-Type: application/json

{"journal_id": "J03"}

### W2 Follow again (409)
POST {{base}}/bookshelf
Content-Type: application/json

{"journal_id": "J03"}

### W2 List bookshelf
GET {{base}}/bookshelf

### W3 Unread notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications?status=unread

### W3 Mark N-I05 read
POST {{base}}/notifications/N-I05/read

### W3 Mark N-I05 read again (409)
POST {{base}}/notifications/N-I05/read

### W4 Articles of J03 issue I05
GET {{base}}/journals/J03/articles?issue_id=I05

### W4 Save A013
POST {{base}}/saved-articles
Content-Type: application/json

{"article_id": "A013"}

### W4 List saved articles
GET {{base}}/saved-articles

### W5 Export BibTeX
GET {{base}}/saved-articles/A013/citation?format=bibtex

### W5 Export RIS
GET {{base}}/saved-articles/A013/citation?format=ris

### Errors: unknown journal (404), unsaved export (409), bad format (422)
GET {{base}}/journals/J99

###
GET {{base}}/saved-articles/A001/citation?format=ris

###
GET {{base}}/saved-articles/A013/citation?format=pdf

### W2 Unfollow J03
DELETE {{base}}/bookshelf/J03
